  "title": "Introducing Nike Hybrid, a New Nike Training Performance Footwear System Built from the Ground Up",
  "summary": "Nike Hybrid is a new Nike Training footwear system built for the unique demands of hybrid training and racing. Featuring the Nike Hybrid Fly and Nike Hybrid RN, it helps athletes move seamlessly between running, lifting and dynamic movement without sacrificing speed, stability or traction.",
